---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="About"
  description="Technical Architect with 11+ years of experience architecting enterprise-scale distributed systems, event-driven microservices, and workflow orchestration platforms."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About Me</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
            Technical Architect / Principal Backend Engineer with 11+ years of experience architecting and delivering enterprise-scale distributed systems, event-driven microservices, and workflow orchestration platforms.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            I specialize in Node.js, TypeScript, and NestJS, with deep expertise in Kafka, RabbitMQ, Redis, Temporal, PostgreSQL, and API Gateway/BFF architectures. My work focuses on designing scalable system architectures, defining messaging topologies, and leading solution delivery from RFPs through production deployment.
          </p>
          
          <div class="bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/20 rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-accent-900 dark:text-accent-100">Core Expertise</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <li>✓ Enterprise distributed systems and microservices architecture</li>
              <li>✓ Event-driven systems with Kafka, RabbitMQ, and MQTT</li>
              <li>✓ Workflow orchestration using Temporal and DAG patterns</li>
              <li>✓ API Gateway, BFF patterns, and OpenAPI contract design</li>
              <li>✓ Solution architecture from RFP to production delivery</li>
              <li>✓ Technical leadership and engineering team mentorship</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Current Focus</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            At InTimeTec, I lead architecture for complex enterprise platforms including:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <li><strong>Nebula:</strong> Robotic workflow and mission orchestration platform with distributed microservices, Kafka event streaming, and Temporal workflow orchestration</li>
            <li><strong>Al-Jouf Saudi Government Platform:</strong> Bilingual digital government platform with e-services, workflow automation, and on-premises Kubernetes deployment</li>
            <li>Healthcare data pipelines, social platform MVPs, and B2B e-commerce systems</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Technology Stack</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
            I work primarily with modern JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystems, complemented by experience across multiple languages and platforms for full-stack delivery:
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Backend & Architecture</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Node.js, NestJS, TypeScript, Java/Spring, .NET, Python</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Messaging & Orchestration</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Kafka, RabbitMQ, Temporal, Debezium, Flink, MQTT</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Data Systems</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">PostgreSQL, Redis, MongoDB, Elasticsearch, Snowflake</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Frontend</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Next.js, React, Angular, Vue</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Cloud & DevOps</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">AWS (S3, Lambda, MSK, Glue), Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Testing & Contracts</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Jest, OpenAPI/Orval, Zod, Docker Compose E2E</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Location & Availability</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-2">
            <strong>Based in:</strong> Jaipur, Rajasthan, India
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            <strong>Open to:</strong> Bengaluru, Delhi-NCR (Delhi/Gurugram/Noida), Hyderabad, Pune, and remote opportunities within India
          </p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Education</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-2">
            <strong>B.Tech. (Information Technology)</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Engineering College Bikaner / Rajasthan Technical University · 2010–2014
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Let's Connect</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            I'm open to discussing Technical Architect, Solutions Architect, and Staff/Principal Backend Engineer opportunities.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a
              href="/nitesh-portfolio/contact"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Get in Touch
            </a>
            <a
              href="/nitesh-portfolio/resume"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              View Full Resume
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
